# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Hongyu Yu et al. (2024). Spin-dependent graph neural network potential for magnetic materials.
#   Physical review. B./Physical review. B. doi:10.1103/physrevb.109.144426  arXiv:2203.02853v2
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2203.02853v2 (sha256 da1ce1408f3f238b...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 402 (Application/model instance). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/yu2024.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: Spin-DimeNet++ models (HEGNN, SEGNN and combined)
# trained on three effective-Hamiltonian data sets generated with PASP
# (a CuMO2 spin Hamiltonian; a Heisenberg-type and a fourth-order
# spin-lattice ABO3 model), Spin-Allegro and plain Allegro trained on a
# DFT+U BiFeO3 data set (4,857 configurations), and their test MAEs.
# Ground-state search and the Neel temperature from spin-lattice
# dynamics are properties.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-yu2024 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Yu et al. (2024): SpinGNN, spin-dependent graph neural network potentials (Spin-DimeNet++, Spin-Allegro) for magnetic materials and BiFeO3" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-yu2024 .

entity:article-yu2024 a schema:ScholarlyArticle ;
    schema:sameAs <https://doi.org/10.1103/physrevb.109.144426> ;
    schema:datePublished "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    schema:name "Spin-dependent graph neural network potential for magnetic materials" ;
